I was able to reproduce it with both `optimization.minify: true`  & `aot: true`.
https://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-pbc8vn

Why both : 
* `optimization.minify` triggers the EsBuild optimizer which escapes the selector : `.über {}` becomes `.\fc ber {
}` ([demo on stackblitz](https://stackblitz.com/edit/node-jr1pmf?file=esbuild.js)). This selector with a space after the escaped character is valid. The space is inserted every time the special character is followed by a hex characters (`0-9a-f`) 
* AOT messes everything up because it interpret's this as 2 different selectors.
